o lead as the premier organization delivering sustainable business excellence, centered on stakeholder benefit. We are dedicated to ensuring client satisfaction and providing job seekers with a healthy, safe, and exceptional workplace that nurtures growth and innovation worldwide, while offering continuous professional development opportunities globally.\\n\\n[p] Vision Strategy\\n\\n[h2] Our Goals, Commitments, Vision for Success\\n\\n[p] As a reliable agency, Catharsis International serves overseas employers and Bangladeshi talent with full transparency. Our ambition is to set the gold standard as Bangladesh\\u2019s most trusted and ethical manpower recruitment partner worldwide ever globally.\\n\\n[p] Leadership Group\\n\\n[h2] Leadership Governance\\n\\n[p] Guided by certified ethical leadership and stringent global quality standards.\\n\\n[h3] Mr. Mohammed Ruhul Amin\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1120', '2026-08-16 13:40:38', '2026-08-16 13:40:38');
INSERT INTO `rewrite_results` (`id`, `rewrite_job_id`, `original_segments`, `rewritten_segments`, `diff_data`, `original_html_hash`, `rewritten_html_hash`, `ai_request_tokens`, `ai_response_tokens`, `ai_duration_ms`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('40', '40', '{\"text\":\"[h1] Recruiting with a Proven, Verifiable, Trusted Record for\\n\\n[p] Founded in 1997 in Dhaka, Catharsis International has built a 27\\u2011year legacy of deploying skilled Bangladeshi workers to employers across Asia and the Gulf, all under a Government License.\\n\\n[p] Catharsis International excels at sourcing and mobilizing a wide spectrum of professionals\\u2014skilled, semi\\u2011skilled, and unskilled. By aligning closely with overseas employers\\u2019 requirements, we distinguish ourselves through extensive testing facilities and efficient mobilization, ensuring rapid deployment, top\\u2011tier quality assurance, and rigorous standards, and thorough compliance.\\n\\n[p] The agency boasts dedicated infrastructure\\u2014its own training centre, medical facilities, and travel agency\\u2014positioning Catharsis as a globally trusted one\\u2011stop provider for international manpower recruitment across the region worldwide for Asia and the Gulf, ensuring seamless placement.\\n\\n[h2] Mission & Vision\\n\\n[p] Our guiding principles steer ethical recruitment and uphold global standards worldwide.\\n\\n[p] Our goal is to generate business value by delighting associates and partners. We tirelessly support clients and partners in achieving their objectives, delivering customized recruitment solutions that drive long\\u2011term success and foster sustainable growth worldwide today.\\n\\n[p] Catharsis Group aims to lead as the premier organization delivering sustainable business excellence, centered on stakeholder benefit. We are dedicated to ensuring client satisfaction and providing job seekers with a healthy, safe, and exceptional workplace that nurtures growth and innovation worldwide, while offering continuous professional development opportunities globally.\\n\\n[p] Vision Strategy\\n\\n[h2] Our Goals, Commitments, Vision for Success\\n\\n[p] As a reliable agency, Catharsis International serves overseas employers and Bangladeshi talent with full transparency. Our ambition is to set the gold standard as Bangladesh\\u2019s most trusted and ethical manpower recruitment partner worldwide ever globally.\\n\\n[p] Leadership Group\\n\\n[h2] Leadership Governance\\n\\n[p] Guided by certified ethical leadership and stringent global quality standards.\\n\\n[h3] Mr. Mohammed Ruhul Amin\"}', '{\"text\":\"[h1] Recruiting with a Proven, Verifiable, Trusted Record Worldwide\\n\\n[p] Founded in 1997 in Dhaka, Catharsis International has built a 27\\u2011year legacy of deploying skilled Bangladeshi workers to employers across Asia and the Gulf under a Government License\\n\\n[p] Catharsis International excels at sourcing and mobilizing a wide spectrum of professionals\\u2014skilled, semi\\u2011skilled, and unskilled. By aligning closely with overseas employers\\u2019 requirements, we distinguish ourselves through extensive testing facilities and efficient mobilization, ensuring rapid deployment, top\\u2011tier quality assurance, rigorous standards, and thorough compliance worldwide for all clients\\n\\n[p] The agency boasts dedicated infrastructure\\u2014its own training centre, medical facilities, and travel agency\\u2014positioning Catharsis as a globally trusted one\\u2011stop provider for international manpower recruitment across the region worldwide for Asia and the Gulf, ensuring seamless placement in all aspects\\n\\n[h2] Mission Vision\\n\\n[p] Our guiding principles steer ethical recruitment while upholding global standards worldwide\\n\\n[p] Our goal is to generate business value by delighting associates and partners. We tirelessly support clients and partners in achieving their objectives, delivering customized recruitment solutions that drive long\\u2011term success and foster sustainable growth worldwide today everywhere\\n\\n[p] Catharsis Group strives to become the leading organization delivering sustainable business excellence, focused on stakeholder benefit. We are committed to ensuring client satisfaction and equipping job seekers with a healthy, safe, and exceptional workplace that nurtures growth and innovation worldwide, while providing continuous ongoing professional development opportunities globally\\n\\n[p] Vision Strategy\\n\\n[h2] Our Goals, Commitments, Vision for Success\\n\\n[p] As a reliable agency, Catharsis International serves overseas employers and Bangladeshi talent with full transparency. Our ambition is to set the gold standard as Bangladesh\\u2019s most trusted and ethical manpower recruitment partner worldwide ever truly globally\\n\\n[p] Leadership Group\\n\\n[h2] Leadership Governance\\n\\n[p] Guided by certified ethical leadership and stringent global quality standards\\n\\n[h3] Mr. Mohammed Ruhul Amin\"}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1120', '2026-08-16 13:46:18', '2026-08-16 13:46:18');

